on place of lime concrete:
    block below event-block is gray stained glass
    cancel event
    if size of {gen::%player%::*} >= 20:
        send "&cYou can only have 20 generators active at once!" to player
        stop
    remove 1 lime concrete from player
    set {_loc} to location of block below event-block
    set block at {_loc} to lime concrete
    add {_loc} to {gen::1::%player%::*}

on right click:
    event-block is lime concrete
    location of event-block is in {gen::1::%player%::*}
    cancel event
    set event-block to gray stained glass
    give player 1 lime concrete
    remove location of event-block from {gen::1::%player%::*}
    
function clearPlacements(p: player):
    loop {gen::1::%{_p}%::*}:
        set block at loop-value to gray stained glass
    delete {gen::1::%{_p}%::*}